  "contentHtml": "<p>&lt;재미있는&nbsp;과학수업&nbsp;만들기&gt;의&nbsp;수업관련자료들은&nbsp;선생님들의&nbsp;'협업'을&nbsp;위해&nbsp;공유되고&nbsp;있습니다.<br>수업을&nbsp;위한&nbsp;자료로만&nbsp;사용해주시기&nbsp;바랍니다.&nbsp;<br>**&nbsp;'말머리'&nbsp;에서&nbsp;해당단원을&nbsp;선택해주세요.&nbsp;수업자료를&nbsp;찾기&nbsp;쉬워집니다.**<br><br>#기체의성질&nbsp;#기압&nbsp;#증발&nbsp;#확산&nbsp;#보일법칙&nbsp;#샤를법칙&nbsp;#영상&nbsp;#구글문서&nbsp;<br><br>안녕하세요&nbsp;과학쌤^^<br>4단원&nbsp;기체의&nbsp;성질&nbsp;관련&nbsp;영상과&nbsp;구글문서&nbsp;활동지를&nbsp;공유해&nbsp;봅니다.<br>필요하신&nbsp;분&nbsp;있으면&nbsp;잘&nbsp;쓰셨으면&nbsp;좋겠습니다!<br>(김정식&nbsp;선생님&nbsp;자료를&nbsp;이용했습니다^^)<br><br>1.&nbsp;확산과&nbsp;증발<br>[구글문서]&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ToEdC6O1vtUo7DTFXDwffphnZp-sb0lHZUQ83WLv0SU/copy\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ToEdC6O1vtUo7DTFXDwffphnZp-sb0lHZUQ83WLv0SU/copy<br></a></p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ToEdC6O1vtUo7DTFXDwffphnZp-sb0lHZUQ83WLv0SU/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ToEdC6O1vtUo7DTFXDwffphnZp-sb0lHZUQ83WLv0SU/edit?usp=sharing</a><br></p><p><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Kumre9xDp8k\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br>2.&nbsp;기체의&nbsp;압력<br>[구글문서]&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1d3lwZQd2fMoEU12SUs_qgjrA6J_7EkmTFvxOgJsI_bE/copy\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1d3lwZQd2fMoEU12SUs_qgjrA6J_7EkmTFvxOgJsI_bE/copy<br></a></p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1d3lwZQd2fMoEU12SUs_qgjrA6J_7EkmTFvxOgJsI_bE/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\"><br></a></p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1d3lwZQd2fMoEU12SUs_qgjrA6J_7EkmTFvxOgJsI_bE/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\"><br></a></p><p><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NUDEc6uqO6o\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br>3.&nbsp;보일법칙<br>[구글문서]&nbsp;<a href=\